<title>JAPAN: Sega suspension due to unclear earnings info - TSE.</title>
<headline>Sega suspension due to unclear earnings info - TSE.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Stock Exchange said on Friday that it had suspended trading of shares in Sega Enterprises Ltd because of unclear information about whether the company will revise its earnings forecast.</p>
<p>The TSE earlier halted trading in the share for the rest of Friday. No more details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
